  "$comment": "Blender-built loner pack models (tools/art/blender/families/pack_loner.py). Replaces the primitive-part placeholders of packs/loner by key; the placeholder is kept as a fallback if a file fails to load, and the materials map onto the game's finishes so a model costs one draw call per finish group. Each moves a part while it is used: the pod's hood, the radio's dial and antenna, a patch of the puzzle, a twig of the bonsai, the sauna's door and the delivery hatch.",
